   "versionNonce": 700245,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "movement suppression comes FIRST, before anything expensive",
   "originalText": "movement suppression comes FIRST, before anything expensive",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dtd0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1290,
   "width": 896,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100036,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700252,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a stationary user - at a desk, asleep - generates an update every 30 seconds that changes nobody's screen. Suppressing\nsub-threshold movement saves on both the write AND the 40x fan-out, and it should be permanent, not an overload measure.\nNote it still updates lastSelfPos, so the timestamp stays fresh and the client's 'updated 4s ago' does not drift.",
   "originalText": "a stationary user - at a desk, asleep - generates an update every 30 seconds that changes nobody's screen. Suppressing\nsub-threshold movement saves on both the write AND the 40x fan-out, and it should be permanent, not an overload measure.\nNote it still updates lastSelfPos, so the timestamp stays fresh and the client's 'updated 4s ago' does not drift.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dt1",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1346,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e40af",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100037,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700259,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "dtn1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1346,
   "width": 576,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100038,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700266,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ordering is resolved by TIMESTAMP at the receiver, not by the transport",
   "originalText": "ordering is resolved by TIMESTAMP at the receiver, not by the transport",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dtd1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1368,
   "width": 889,
   "height": 30,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100039,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700273,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "fire-and-forget pub/sub gives no ordering guarantee, and buying one would mean ordered channels with sequence tracking.\nComparing pos.ts against the cached position achieves the same user-visible outcome in one line, for free.",
   "originalText": "fire-and-forget pub/sub gives no ordering guarantee, and buying one would mean ordered channels with sequence tracking.\nComparing pos.ts against the cached position achieves the same user-visible outcome in one line, for free.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dt2",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1424,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "#b91c1c",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100040,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700280,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
